##### Decision Variables

- $y_i \in \{0,1\}$: 1 if service centre $i$ is opened, 0 otherwise, for $i \in I = \{\text{SC1},\ldots,\text{SC10}\}$.
- $x_{ij} \in \{0,1\}$: 1 if customer $j$ is assigned to centre $i$, 0 otherwise, for $i \in I$, $j \in J = \{\text{C1},\ldots,\text{C15}\}$.

##### Parameters

- $f_i$: Fixed opening cost for centre $i$.
- $c_{ij}$: Cost to serve customer $j$ from centre $i$.

###### Service Centre Fixed Opening Costs

\[
\begin{align*}
f_{\text{SC1}} &= 385.1 \\
f_{\text{SC2}} &= 546.3 \\
f_{\text{SC3}} &= 485.2 \\
f_{\text{SC4}} &= 448.1 \\
f_{\text{SC5}} &= 324.1 \\
f_{\text{SC6}} &= 323.9 \\
f_{\text{SC7}} &= 296.5 \\
f_{\text{SC8}} &= 522.7 \\
f_{\text{SC9}} &= 448.7 \\
f_{\text{SC10}} &= 478.7 \\
\end{align*}
\]

###### Customer–Centre Service Cost Matrix $c_{ij}$

